    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is onto if <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is an element of the set <math><mi>P</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is one-one if <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is an element of the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>,&nbsp;then (given,&nbsp;<math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is a real number)",
