    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is one-one, then&nbsp;<math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Further,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has range <math><mi>R</mi></math> for <math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8834;</mo><mi>P</mi></math>",
